NOTES:\P\pxi-3,l3,t2.14103;1.^IALL PIPE SIZES ARE ASME OD BASED\P2.^IVESSEL DESIGNED AS PER ASME SEC VIII DIV.01 STANDARD  \P3.^IALL CLEAN UTILITY AND PROCESS PIPES & FITTINGS ARE BS4825 STANDARD \P4.^IFOR BLACK UTILITY, PIPES & FITTINGS WILL BE AS PER B
  3
S4825 STANDARD \P5.^IALL EQUIPMENT ARE DESIGNED FOR NON-FLAMEPROOF AREA \P6.^IALL TEMPERATURE SENSORS WILL BE FOR THE RANGE OF 0 TO 150 °C. SIMPLEX SENSORS ARE CONSIDERED FOR ALL TEMPERATURE SENSORS.  \P7.^IVENT FILTER INTEGRITY TO BE CHECKED BEFORE STE
  3
RILIZATION AND AFTER BATCH IS OVER (EMPTY VESSEL). IN BOTH CASES DIFFUSED AIR & FLUID SHALL BE TAKEN IN VESSEL \P8.^IPLC SHALL BE PROVIDED WITH 20% SPARE I/O FOR BOTH ANALOGUE AND DIGITAL SIGNAL. PANEL IS PROVIDED WITH 20% FREE SPACE  \P9.^ISTIRRER RPM
  3
 WILL BE BASED ON FEEDBACK RECEIVED FROM VFD & WITH RPM SENSOR & TRANSMITTER CONSIDERED{\fTrebuchet MS|b0|i0|c0|p34; } \P10.^I CUSTOMER TO USE INSTALLATION  TOOL & TIGHTENING TOOL FOR MALE BEARING AND MIXING HEAD OF MAGNETIC MIXER, INCASE ON ANY MAINT
  3
ENANCE. ALL TOOLS ARE IN CLIENT'S SCOPE \P11.^I TRANSFER IN LINE FOR MANUFACTURING VESSEL, CIP & SIP SHALL BE DONE ALONG WITH THE VESSEL USING SPOOL PIECE, CONSIDERING NON STERILE ADDITION \P12.^I TRANSFER LINE FROM MANUFACTURING VESSEL TO HOLDING VESS
  3
EL SHALL BE SUBJECTED TO CIP IN ONCE THROUGH MODE. CLEANING VALIDATION IS TIMER BASED    \P13.^I ALL AIR FILTERS AND ALL LIQUID FILTERS CARTRIDGES ARE IN CLIENT'S SCOPE \P14.^I SLOPE FOR PIPING WILL BE CONSIDERED AS PER ASME BPE STANDARDS \P15.^I ALL CO
  3
MPONENTS MARKED IN GREY ARE IN CLIENT'S SCOPE \P16.^I PRESSURE HOLD TEST OF TRANSFER LINE WILL BE DONE ALONG WITH VESSEL.\P17.^I ALL VESSELS ARE SUBJECTED TO ESIP BY PASSING PURE STEAM INTO THE VESSEL. \P18.^I SS 304 RACK TO BE PROVIDED FOR HOLDING SENS
  3
ORS WHEN NOT IN USED\P19.^ICIP SHALL BE DONE BY WFI ONLY FOR ALL VESSELS AND TRANSFER LINES. AS PER DISCUSSION WITH CLIENT ONE OF THE PRODUCT REQUIRED ACID & ALKALI DOSING FOR CIP THATS WHY DOSING BOTTLES \P\pi0;KEPT ON CIP SKID\P\pl0,tz;20. AT A TIME
  3
 ONLY VESSEL WILL BE OPERATIONAL FROM EACH AREA.\P21. PRODUCT TRANSFER FROM 100L MFG. TO 100L HOLDING SHALL BE DONE. PRODUCT TRANSFER FROM 1000L MFG. TO 1000L HOLDING SHALL BE DONE.\P22. NA CONNECT WITH 5 PORT SS NOVASEPTUM HOLDER ONLY CONSIDERED IN 
  3
PHS SCOPE. HOWEVER, ACCESSORIES LIKE MAGAZINE, NEEDLE, SEPTUM, TUBES, BAGS, CRIMPING TOOL SHALL BE IN CLIENT'S SCOPE.\P23. BI INDICATOR (BI), SMART CLAMP, SMART GASKET FOR BI & VALIDATION PORT SHALL BE IN CLIENT'S SCOPE.\P24. AS PER CLIENT REQUIREMEN
  1
T, CLEANING OF GAS/ VENT FILTER IS NOT PART OF CIP PROCESS SEQUENCE.
  7
